  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2304.04 Administrative Fine Hearings. Env-C 200 shall apply to all administrative fine hearings and adjudication of the total proposed fine shall be in accordance with Env-C 204.24.\n\nSource. #14658, eff 7-18-26, EXPIRES: 7-18-36\n\nAPPENDIX A: STATE STATUTES IMPLEMENTED",
